    {
      "message_id": 172168,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "138025700",
      "user_name": "Ryo",
      "time": "2026-08-15T07:42:35+00:00",
      "preview": "Rune folded up the bipod and puts it away before slinging the rifle and over his shoulder, keeping an eye on the ysoki as he does this. Satisfied with what he sees he steps over to the others, his fingers flying as he types on his holo-keyboard closely followed by the computerized voice.\n\n\"It's all good. Bit of a pain to fight, but wasn't going to stop us.\n\nLoving the music, all the bass and that fucking drum solo. Shaking the ground and right through me.\"",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
    {
      "message_id": 172170,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "8097377199",
      "user_name": "Terra",
      "time": "2026-08-15T07:48:07+00:00",
      "preview": "\"Sorry, I'm still confused what is happening?\"",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
    {
      "message_id": 172202,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "6144366145",
      "user_name": "Anthony",
      "time": "2026-08-15T09:55:43+00:00",
      "preview": "Livy responds to Nikk-Nakk as he says this\n\"\u2605YAAAAAAAYYY\u2605\"",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
    {
      "message_id": 172203,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "6144366145",
      "user_name": "Anthony",
      "time": "2026-08-15T09:55:45+00:00",
      "preview": "Then she's gonna turn to  @Saiminaminah that just shot the slime dead:\n\"\u2605HEY\u2605 Thanks for the help! \" She walks up to this person and takes their hand with both of her hands to greet them.\n\"By the way who are you? \u2605WAIT\u2605 I know!! Are you?! ONE OF MY \u2605SUPERFANS\u2605 THAT CAME TO MY RESCUE!? \nI appreciate the thought but... \u2605STALKING\u2605 is bad you know!\"",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
    {
      "message_id": 172204,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "8097377199",
      "user_name": "Terra",
      "time": "2026-08-15T10:11:02+00:00",
      "preview": "\"I'm...Lai\" he replied unsure....",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
    {
      "message_id": 172331,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "6144366145",
      "user_name": "Anthony",
      "time": "2026-08-16T06:23:55+00:00",
      "preview": "\"\u2605HUH\u2605?! You don't know what a \u2605SUPERFAN\u2605 is!?\" What are you doing here then? Actually... \u2605I DONT CARE :) !\u2605\"\n\nLivy leaves Lai and goes to speak to Nikk-Nakk.\n\n\"\u2605NIKK-NAKK\u2605, you didn't tell us that there were \u2605GHOSTBOTS\u2605 at your scrapyard! That's not very \u2605NICE\u2605. What if i had gotten a scratch on my \u2605SUPER IDOL BODY\u2605 huh? Were you gonna pay for my medical bills? It's \u2605EXPENSIVE\u2605 you know!\"",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
    {
      "message_id": 172448,
      "thread_id": 52083,
      "user_id": "8097377199",
      "user_name": "Terra",
      "time": "2026-08-16T11:50:25+00:00",
      "preview": "Lai stares dumbfounded and looks at the being next to him  (Roneles) for clarification",
      "media_group_id": null
    },
